            <h3>Meal & Beverage Options</h3>
            <p>American and LATAM include complimentary meal service with wine and beer on this international route, a meaningful difference on a six-hour flight. LATAM's catering nods to Peruvian flavors, an appropriate preview of what awaits. Sky Airline sells all food and beverages à la carte; its passengers would be wise to eat before boarding or bring sandwiches from Miami's excellent Cuban bakeries. Special meals on American and LATAM require 24 to 48 hours' advance notice.</p>
            <h3>Comfort & Amenities</h3>
            <ul>
